# clausal: no-collect
# Vocabulary module for the predicate-not-found candidate diagnostic
# (todo/done/predicate-not-found-should-list-candidates.md).  Reproduces the shape
# of the reported module: it defines `citation/3`, and the sibling that calls
# `citation/2` cannot see it.
-module(prednf_citations, [citation(REF, TEXT, NOTE), cite(REF)])

-private([art_1_2, meta])

citation(art_1_2, "EUMR Article 1(2)", meta),

cite(art_1_2),
